     negatives — if "ρ = 0.92" in conclusion → "pooled" AND "in-sample"
     AND `\ref{sec:annex-screen}` must accompany; if in discussion →
     "existence proof" AND ("in-sample" OR "tuned on the same") must
     accompany. Exact phrasings → brief.
